xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Ayush Pandey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136017751,imgsize-108105.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Centre moves to tighten controls on antibiotic manufacturing, bulk drug trade]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/centre-moves-to-tighten-controls-on-antibiotic-manufacturing-bulk-drug-trade/articleshow/136017617.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136017617.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[The Centre plans to introduce stringent regulations on antibiotic manufacturing and distribution as a strategy to counteract antimicrobial resistance. Newly proposed measures require manufacturers to secure central approval for antimicrobial licenses, coupled with enhanced quality assessments. Wholesalers will also need distinct licenses for bulk drugs, promoting improved monitoring. Stakeholders are encouraged to provide public comments on these draft amendments prior to their finalization.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/centre-moves-to-tighten-controls-on-antibiotic-manufacturing-bulk-drug-trade/articleshow/136017617.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/centre-moves-to-tighten-controls-on-antibiotic-manufacturing-bulk-drug-trade/articleshow/136017617.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-20T12:51:35+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Anuja Jaiswal</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136017696,imgsize-45984.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Medicines may face tighter checks from factory to pharmacy under new Centre proposal]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/medicines-may-face-tighter-checks-from-factory-to-pharmacy-under-new-centre-proposal/articleshow/136017634.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136017634.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[The Centre is proposing to enhance quality checks for medicines throughout their distribution chain. Good Storage and Distribution Practices are to be integrated into the existing Drugs Rules to ensure safety. This initiative aims to address risks associated with the supply chain, including contamination and unauthorized distribution. Stakeholders have been invited to submit their objections and suggestions to the proposed guidelines.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/medicines-may-face-tighter-checks-from-factory-to-pharmacy-under-new-centre-proposal/articleshow/136017634.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/medicines-may-face-tighter-checks-from-factory-to-pharmacy-under-new-centre-proposal/articleshow/136017634.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-20T12:50:37+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Anuja Jaiswal</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136017698,imgsize-80150.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Nepal PM Balen Shah's first India visit on November 23, talks with PM Modi on agenda]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/nepal-pm-balen-shahs-first-india-visit-on-november-23-talks-with-pm-modi-on-agenda/articleshow/136016205.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136016205.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/nepal-pm-balen-shahs-first-india-visit-on-november-23-talks-with-pm-modi-on-agenda/articleshow/136016205.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/nepal-pm-balen-shahs-first-india-visit-on-november-2